# covers: 2 E3.3, 2 E3.6, 2 E5.4, 2 E5.5
# fixture: phase2-transfer-observer
# Paired with observer-a; B separate account at126126 has no private access to A.
# Check actual world proxies, public event count and absence of another owner's resources.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.ClassCatalogue
nf.WaitFor class_rpc_error == none 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor other_players >= 1 45
nf.WaitFor other_player_class == 1 45
nf.WaitFor other_player_class == 2 30
nf.Expect observed_class_transfers == 2
nf.Expect private_stats_leaks == 0
nf.Expect proxy_actors_in_sync
nf.Within 120
